            "block_content": "F. Office Automation—Employees who operate video display terminals more than six (6) hours each work day and who are pregnant will, upon their request, have the right to transfer immediately to another job with the Board. There will be no loss of pay, seniority or fringe benefits because of this transfer. The employee's return to work after pregnancy will be as provided in Article 12, Section H.",
